  itemDetailsList:
  - itemName: 4
    itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bbc6c86941f95fe44b04e95f280b2819, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: The candle is lighted...
  - itemName: 5
    itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0eb5a74e5d2b0154a8681a89c3b262cb, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: 'A large, ornate brooch bearing the crest of the Hold family, hidden
      in the saddle bag in the stables. The pin is exceptionally sharp and coated
      in blood.

      The brooch appears to be missing one of its jewels...'
  - itemName: 6
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: A torn letter penned by Admiral Hold filing for divorce from his wife,
      Theodosia. The letter is dated the day before his death. The reason for the
      divorce is not listed. Or perhaps it was written on the other half of the page...?
  - itemName: 9
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: A note from Theodosia to Charles requesting he refrain from dismissing
      the maid.
  - itemName: 10
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: You picked it up!
  - itemName: 11
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: A bloody hand is imprinted on the windowsill. A trail of blood then
      runs from the windowsill towards the stables...
  - itemName: 12
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: A pair of gloves found in Maximillian's room. Once white, now stained
      red by blood. They are monogrammed with Theodosia's initials.
  - itemName: 13
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: A portrait of the Hold Family. A very large brooch is pinned to the
      Admiral's chest.
  - itemName: 14
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: A delicate wooden trellis attached to the side of the house, sitting
      just above a window on the second floor. Several of its crossbars have been
      snapped in two, as though someone attempted to climb it...
  - itemName: 7
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 100
    itemInfo: A love letter between Lavender and Dorothy. Testing to see if this
      works!
  - itemName: 8
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: An unnamed
  - itemName: 16
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: A door key.
  - itemName: 17
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: "A particularly risqu\xE9 love letter written by Dorothy Tendwell addressed
      to Lavender Ditch. It includes a particularly saucy sketch of Dorothy's ankle.\n\"Lavender,
      my love,\nI have included the drawing you requested. I  hope you will visit
      me tonight again so you can see, touch- and taste- the real thing.\nForever
      yours, Dorothy xoxo \""
  - itemName: 27
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: A pair of gloves with Maximillian's monogrammed initials. Theodosia
      is wearing them, for some strange reason.
  - itemName: 18
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: A bucket full of blood-tainted water. Perhaps the killer used this
      to wash the blood from their hands...?
  - itemName: 21
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: A messy pile of hay covered in blood. You think the killer may have
      tried to wipe the blood from their hands here...
  - itemName: 23
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    value: 0
    itemInfo: Avery's book!
